looking ill for some time. My ten year old cried, the 5 year old doesn't remember him, yet, but is a big fan of Cody and Stardust.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":256,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","user":"Gnomish American","date":". 06-15-2015, 10:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T08:33:44-07:00","id":555724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gnomish American</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/555461-anyone-else-follow-wrestling?p=555642#post555642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a fan, haven't been able to watch anything since WrestleMania, though. I'm sad to hear that MitB was mediocre its my favorite non-big 4 PPV.</div> </div> </div> </div>There hasn't been a huge amount that's changed since then, honestly. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Dean Ambrose and Seth Rollins have been feuding over the world heavyweight champion title, and they keep teasing like there's going to be a big shake-up - but every time it matters Rollins finds some not-always-aboveboard way to retain the title, and so nothing's really changed since Wrestlemania on that score. The other big story right now is a feud between John Cena and NXT champion Kevin Owens. Oh, and Ryback now holds the intercontinental title after Daniel Bryan had to stop wrestling, but they really haven't done much with that story. I mean, his match last night lasted maybe five minutes and ended by D/Q.<br /> <br /> It's not entirely surprising - I get the feeling they're drawing some stuff out until SummerSlam - but it does kinda feel like they're spinning their wheels on some of the storylines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T10:38:36-07:00","id":555847,"title":"","content":"I follow it, but not with complete consistency.<br /> <br /> I could agree with the spinning their wheels idea. It seems like every few days Kevin Owens makes fun of Cena, then throws out an open call to anyone who's wiling to challenge them, then beats up some jobber or another. So they'll probably spur on some more long-lasting rivalries like that. The Paige v Bella Twins thing isn't near over.<br /> <br /> I have to admit, I've been liking NXT a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-15-2015, 02:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T15:42:06-07:00","id":559866,"title":"","content":"Anyone here seen anything of Lucha Underground and, if so, what did you think of it?<br /> <br /> Edit: About NXT, I have heard it has been really good since last year. Can someone confirm? I might have to figure out how to get all the episodes I missed if that is the case. Or maybe I just start from 2015 if that turns out to be much easier...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T16:19:08-07:00","id":559950,"title":"","content":"I haven't seen much of Lucha Underground but I've heard it's good. Really plays up the telenovela.<br /> <br /> NXT is fun, there's a small stable but they're pretty good. Some of the divas are particularly impressive, which is a nice change from standard WWE. But all around there's a lot more skill shown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T16:01:20-07:00","id":596235,"title":"","content":"One hour until Battleground. Anyone feel like discussing during?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Battleground's finished. Surprisingly, given the relatively low position of this PPV, every single match was pretty top-shelf stuff. Some very surprising twists got thrown in, too - there's one in particular that's got everyone's attention right now, though I won't spoil it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":16,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","user":"Cielle","date":". 07-19-2015, 10:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}